<title>USA: Cybernetic CEO Neil Kohrn resigns.</title>
<headline>Cybernetic CEO Neil Kohrn resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cybernetic Services Inc said Wednesday that Chief Executive Officer Neil Kohrn has resigned effective immediately.</p>
<p>Kohrn said in a statement he resigned for personal and health reasons but he will continue to serve the firm as a consultant for an unspecified length of time.</p>
<p>A replacement was not announced.</p>
</text>
